 inspired by her grandfather's captivating stories. <br>With her imposing presence on the battlefield and her steadfast sense of duty, she stands as a pillar of courage and honor, ready to face any challenge in her tireless quest for a better world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/9c2a14b556a2ba14f7cd05f91c91d8f9.poster.avif?t=1721693857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/9c2a14b556a2ba14f7cd05f91c91d8f9.webm?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/9c2a14b556a2ba14f7cd05f91c91d8f9.mp4?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Haunted by her past, Wendy Woods bears the weight of her Wendigo curse. <br>Despite this, she's determined to prove that she's not a monster, bravely battling against her own nature and facing the challenges that cross her path.<br>Her aura of solitude hides a heart full of determination and the pursuit of redemption.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/28fce9e2d0974b6822c65cae9d8c92a5.poster.avif?t=1721693857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/28fce9e2d0974b6822c65cae9d8c92a5.webm?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/28fce9e2d0974b6822c65cae9d8c92a5.mp4?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cherry Baba, the Slime Queen, radiates undeniable power, yet harbors doubts and the need to prove her worth to herself and others. <br>Her journey is not only one of leadership but also of self-discovery and inner empowerment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/94a5cf93a76bf90690e37a34afd8fa2f.poster.avif?t=1721693857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/94a5cf93a76bf90690e37a34afd8fa2f.webm?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/94a5cf93a76bf90690e37a34afd8fa2f.mp4?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lisa Evergreen, known to many as &quot;Lisa the Merciless,&quot; is an intriguing figure in the world of shadows. <br>Her keen cunning and undeniable business acumen have earned her a fearsome reputation. However, beneath her unflappable facade beats a proud heart.<br>Despite her inclination for money and gains, Lisa is not unfamiliar with the complexities of loyalty and honor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/63ad3d14dbea1e75a750bc7e2eb44b5c.poster.avif?t=1721693857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/63ad3d14dbea1e75a750bc7e2eb44b5c.webm?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/63ad3d14dbea1e75a750bc7e2eb44b5c.mp4?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gabriel, a replica of her divine namesake, represents an earthly manifestation of the celestial. While her form is more &quot;human,&quot; her essence is an inexhaustible source of mystery and wisdom. <br>Through the journey alongside you, Gabriel will not only explore the world around her but also her own being.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/b8fc60a0c556e31819fbe61d00f6fb73.avif?t=1721693857\" /></span><br><br>&quot;Tits and Shadows&quot; goes beyond being merely an erotic game. We take pride in presenting the following features that make this game a unique experience:<br><br><strong>**More Than 4 Hours of Immersive Content:**</strong><br>Embark on an epic journey that will take you through a rich and diverse world, filled with challenges, secrets, and unforgettable discoveries.<br><br><strong>**Classic Turn-Based RPG:**</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the nostalgia of turn-based gameplay, where each action is carefully chosen before the action is unleashed, allowing you to strategically plan your moves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/8fbab69fcb9497ce7bb7cef3fff165bd.poster.avif?t=1721693857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/8fbab69fcb9497ce7bb7cef3fff165bd.webm?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/8fbab69fcb9497ce7bb7cef3fff165bd.mp4?t=1721693857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>**God Mode:**</strong><br>If you prefer not to engage in combat, use God Mode to enjoy everything else the game has to offer. Immerse yourself in the story, explore the world, and uncover secrets without worrying about battle encounters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/75289417f6614b7703e0c0a9a5002d27.poster.avif?t=1721693857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418740/extras/75289417f6614b7703e0c0a9a5002d27.web